WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.353
In this video, you set up the encounter screen with a workspace. Step 1.

1.2
00:00:05.353 --> 00:00:06.699
Open the workspace.

1.3
00:00:06.699 --> 00:00:12.770
To find a Draft workspace, select the Draft tab, then select its name.

2.1
00:00:12.770 --> 00:00:18.323
Step 2. Choose a starter. Blank gives one empty tab named Overview.

2.2
00:00:18.323 --> 00:00:22.860
A starter changes nothing for users until you save.

3.1
00:00:22.860 --> 00:00:26.543
Step 3. Arrange the tabs. Select Add tab.

3.2
00:00:26.543 --> 00:00:32.236
Under Built-in tabs, you can add a standard Care tab, such as Notes.

3.3
00:00:32.236 --> 00:00:35.499
A lock icon marks a built-in tab.

4.1
00:00:35.499 --> 00:00:41.121
Step 4. Choose the layout of a tab. In the Layout row, select a layout.

4.2
00:00:41.121 --> 00:00:46.539
Main plus side gives a wide Main column and a narrow Side column.

5.1
00:00:46.539 --> 00:00:52.181
Step 5. Add sections. At the bottom of a column, select Add a section.

5.2
00:00:52.181 --> 00:00:55.493
To find a section, type in Search sections.

5.3
00:00:55.493 --> 00:01:04.568
Select the section, and Care adds it to that column.

6.1
00:01:04.568 --> 00:01:10.666
Step 6. Arrange the sections. Drag a section to another place or column.

6.2
00:01:10.666 --> 00:01:16.609
Or select its three-dot button, then Move up, Move down or Move to.

7.1
00:01:16.609 --> 00:01:23.056
Step 7. Set the title and options of a section. Select the title of the section.

7.2
00:01:23.056 --> 00:01:27.162
Enter the title that users see, then set the options,

7.3
00:01:27.162 --> 00:01:30.760
such as Submitted by and Latest results.

8.1
00:01:30.760 --> 00:01:33.747
Step 8. Choose when the section shows.

8.2
00:01:33.747 --> 00:01:39.724
In Show this section, select an option, such as Only while the encounter is active.

8.3
00:01:39.724 --> 00:01:43.393
This choice is only on the Encounter screen.

9.1
00:01:43.393 --> 00:01:47.401
Step 9. Close the section settings. Select Done.

9.2
00:01:47.401 --> 00:01:51.894
Done is not available while a setting is not valid.

10.1
00:01:51.894 --> 00:01:58.098
Step 10. Preview the design. The canvas uses sample content, not patient records.

10.2
00:01:58.098 --> 00:02:04.404
Select Closed encounter to see which sections hide when an encounter is closed.

11.1
00:02:04.404 --> 00:02:10.641
Step 12. Save the design. Select Save Changes. Care shows Workspace updated.

11.2
00:02:10.641 --> 00:02:16.418
If the workspace is Active, people who chose it see the new design.
